# Build/runtime artifacts -- never source of truth.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# Blaze convenience symlinks, if any ever land here.
blaze-*

# Point-in-time source backups taken before a risky edit (infra-v12..v18).
# They are snapshots, not history -- git is the history. Keeping them out of
# the index stops each generation from re-adding another 20 near-identical
# copies of route_check.py. Delete them once the change they guard is committed.
*.bak_*
*.bak.*
*.orig
# Rendered/templated inputs and runtime state: regenerated, or per-machine.
*.in
*.log
*.json
